        "move_id": "",
        "description": "Auto-generated from selected effects:\n\n- Item Sitrus Berry:\nPokémon can use it or carry it to restore some HP.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Fling base power: 10.\n\n- Item Leftovers:\nThey gradually restore the HP of the Pokémon carrying them during battle.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Heals holder by 1/16 max HP at end of each turn.\n- Fling base power: 10.\n\n- Item Wide Lens:\nIt must be carried by a Pokémon.Slightly increases the precision of movements.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Fling base power: 10.\n\n- Item Expert Belt:\nSlightly boosts super-effective moves by 20%.It must be carried by a Pokémon.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Super-effective moves deal 1.2x damage.\n- Fling base power: 10.\n\n- Move Draining Kiss:\nFairy-type special move. Target: Nearother.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Base power: 60.\n- Accuracy: 100%.\n- Base PP: 10.\n- Recovers HP equal to 3/4 of damage dealt.\n- Internal function code: HealUserByThreeQuartersOfDamageDone.\n\n- Move Fake Out:\nNormal-type physical move. Target: Nearother.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Base power: 40.\n- Accuracy: 100%.\n- Base PP: 10.\n- Priority: +3.\n- Internal function code: FlinchTargetFailsIfNotUserFirstTurn.\n\n- Move Nasty Plot:\nDark-type status move. Target: User.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Accuracy: no standard accuracy roll (self-target or guaranteed effect).\n- Base PP: 20.\n- Raises Sp. Atk of user by 2 stages.\n- Internal function code: RaiseUserSpAtk2.\n\n- Move Swords Dance:\nFrenzied dance that greatly increases Attack.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Accuracy: no standard accuracy roll (self-target or guaranteed effect).\n- Base PP: 10.\n- Raises Attack of user by 2 stages.\n- Internal function code: RaiseUserAttack2.\n\n- Ability Speed Boost:\nIncreases the user's Speed ​​by one level at the end of each turn.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- At end of each turn, raises Speed by 1 stage.",
        "consumable": false,
        "show_quantity": true
      },
