        "description": "Auto-generated from selected effects:\n\n- Item Leftovers:\nThey gradually restore the HP of the Pokémon carrying them during battle.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Heals holder by 1/16 max HP at end of each turn.\n- Fling base power: 10.\n\n- Item Big Root:\nBoosts moves that steal HP.It must be carried by a Pokémon.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Drain/healing-from-damage effects are multiplied by 1.3x.\n- Fling base power: 10.\n\n- Item Black Belt:\nIt must be carried by a Pokémon.Increases decisiveness and strengthens Fighting type attacks.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Fling base power: 30.\n\n- Item Expert Belt:\nSlightly boosts super-effective moves by 20%.It must be carried by a Pokémon.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Super-effective moves deal 1.2x damage.\n- Fling base power: 10.\n\n- Item Punching Glove:\nGlove that increases the power of fist movements and prevents them from making contact with the opponent.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Fling base power: 30.\n\n- Move Draining Kiss:\nFairy-type special move. Target: Nearother.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Base power: 60.\n- Accuracy: 100%.\n- Base PP: 10.\n- Recovers HP equal to 3/4 of damage dealt.\n- Internal function code: HealUserByThreeQuartersOfDamageDone.\n\n- Move Hone Claws:\nThe user sharpens their claws to increase their Attack and Accuracy.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Accuracy: no standard accuracy roll (self-target or guaranteed effect).\n- Base PP: 15.\n- Raises Attack and Accuracy of user by 1 stage.\n- Internal function code: RaiseUserAtkAcc1.\n\n- Ability Sheer Force:\nNo ability description exists in the current game data.\n\n- Ability Speed Boost:\nIncreases the user's Speed ​​by one level at the end of each turn.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- At end of each turn, raises Speed by 1 stage.",
